## Common Agent Workflows

### Workflow 1: Onboard to New Project

```
Step 1: Explore agent (quick) → Get structure overview
Step 2: Explore agent (thorough) → Deep dive on specific areas
Step 3: Plan agent → Design first contribution
Step 4: Implement with guidance
```

### Workflow 2: Plan Major Feature

```
Step 1: Explore agent → Understand current implementation
Step 2: Plan agent → Design new feature
Step 3: Review plan → Get approval
Step 4: Implement
```

### Workflow 3: Investigate Bug

```
Step 1: General-purpose agent → Research bug patterns
Step 2: Explore agent → Find related code
Step 3: General-purpose agent → Trace root cause
Step 4: Plan agent → Design fix
Step 5: Implement
```

